{
  "gui.guhs.kleding.prijs.hint.verrassingsfeestje_onder_de_wol": "in the chest of a Surprise Party under the wool",
  "item.guhs.feesthoedje": "Party Hat",
  "item.guhs.slinger_sjaaltje": "Bunting Scarf",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_bank.1": "I've guarded this vault for a hundred years. There was only one break-in. By a Mika. It failed. Njeg!",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_bank.2": "See those paw prints? Mika came through the wall, but the vault held. Just a little dent.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_bank.3": "Interest? Zero point zero nibbles. But your savings are very cosy together.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_bank.4": "The door code? I forgot it. Luckily the door is open.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_bank.5": "Take something, go on. The old bank guhs retired long ago.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_disco.1": "Hands in the air! Every dancer gives vads power to the Disco Dynamo!",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_disco.2": "I'm DJ Njeg. My favourite record? 'Vahoeg, vahoeg', the remix.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_disco.3": "Up there it's just a mountain of wool. Down here it's a party. Don't tell anyone!",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_disco.4": "A milkshake at the bar? Strawberry, mint or choco. Free, if you dance.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_disco.5": "Danced out? Sit on a cushion for a bit. Five minutes. Then back to vadsing!",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_feestje.1": "SURPRISE! Oh, it's only you. We're still practising.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_feestje.2": "This party is for you! Or for whoever walks in. So, for you!",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_feestje.3": "There's a guh inside one of the presents. Guess which one. No shaking!",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_feestje.4": "The cake is made of plush blocks. Don't bite, do cuddle. Njeg!",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_feestje.5": "Grab a party hat from the chest. A party without a hat doesn't count.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_kuil.1": "...8, 9, 10! Ready or not! Have you seen the others? They're somewhere in the plushies.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_kuil.2": "Hide and seek is the best game. Unless you're the seeker. Then it's the second best.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_kuil.3": "Jump into the pit! You sink a little into the plushies.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_kuil.4": "Shoes off, please! Guhs don't have shoes, so that's easy.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_kuil.5": "Found guhs have often fallen asleep. Give them a pet to wake them up!",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_spinnerij.1": "Welcome to De Wolclub! Long ago everything was grey. Then we picked up our spinning wheels... and now? Pink! Vahoeg!",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_spinnerij.2": "Nobody has to work here. We spin because it's cosy. And every five minutes there's a break.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_spinnerij.3": "The water wheel makes vads power. It turns the spinning wheels, so our paws don't have to.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_spinnerij.4": "Take a bale of wool, go on. There's plenty of wool, the whole Guhmension is full of it!",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_spinnerij.5": "In the weaving corner we make little rugs, blankets and fabrics for guh clothes.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_sterren.1": "Look, there! That constellation is called the Great Cheese Nibble.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_sterren.2": "You see the stars best under the ground. No little clouds in the way!",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_sterren.3": "I counted them all. There are... uh... a lot. Vahoeg.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_sterren.4": "Lie down on a cushion and look up. You'll turn a little vads all by yourself.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_tempel.1": "This temple is older than the cheese. And the cheese is very old.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_tempel.2": "The old guhs built everything from soft stone. So nobody got hurt walking into it.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_tempel.3": "At the back stands the Great Guh with the Golden Cheese Nibble. Don't lick it, I tried.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_tempel.4": "There's a hole in the forecourt. I know, because I was in it. Njeg!",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_tempel.5": "The slide in the east wing is the fastest way out. Wheee!",
